NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000241 "=head1 HISTORY"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000242 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000243 "2021-11-28: Created modelled from L<Data::Sah::Coerce> and L<Data::Sah::Filter>"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000244 "to be able to express dynamic default value into schema."
